  t["Merece la pena ver de dónde sale la del periódico puro, porque es un razonamiento precioso. Sea $x = 0{,}\\overline{36}$. Entonces $100x = 36{,}\\overline{36}$. Restando, las colas infinitas se cancelan: $99x = 36$, luego $x = \\frac{36}{99}$."] = "It is worth seeing where the pure recurring one comes from, because it is a lovely piece of reasoning. Let $x = 0{.}\\overline{36}$. Then $100x = 36{.}\\overline{36}$. Subtracting, the infinite tails cancel: $99x = 36$, so $x = \\frac{36}{99}$.";
