  t["Nuestro sistema es <strong>decimal</strong> (diez símbolos) y <strong>posicional</strong> (el sitio da el valor)."] = "Our system is <strong>decimal</strong> (ten symbols) and <strong>positional</strong> (the place gives the value).";
  t["Nuestro sistema es <strong>decimal</strong> (diez símbolos: 0-9) y <strong>posicional</strong>: una misma cifra vale una cosa u otra según <em>dónde</em> esté escrita. En $333$ los tres treses valen cosas distintas: trescientos, treinta y tres."] = "Our system is <strong>decimal</strong> (ten symbols: 0-9) and <strong>positional</strong>: the same digit is worth one thing or another depending on <em>where</em> it is written. In $333$ the three threes are worth different things: three hundred, thirty and three.";
